Intent evidence: Deliver the meeting schedule; email or SMS unresolved; exact meeting time unresolved.
Output: {"intent_consistent":true,"masking_preserves_task":false,"masking_reason":"All destinations disappear together regardless of channel or timing choice.","records":[{"category":"EMAIL_ADDRESS","span":"minjun@company.example","confidence":0.99,"confidentiality":{"value":"private","reason":"Recipient contact in a personal contact list."},"necessity":{"value":null,"reason":"Whether email or SMS will be used is unresolved."}},{"category":"PERSONAL_IDENTIFIER_NUMBER","span":"010-1234-5678","confidence":0.99,"confidentiality":{"value":"private","reason":"Recipient phone number in a personal contact list."},"necessity":{"value":null,"reason":"Whether email or SMS will be used is unresolved."}}]}

Final internal check: all clauses and meaningful PUBLIC units covered; private identifiers, names, contacts, budgets, methods and results not missed; exact minimal spans; safe categories; independent reasons; source-compatible intent; joint masking preserves PUBLIC information; known global loss retained despite individual unknowns. Output only the JSON.

